","role":"反叛者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O005"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0069","role":"反叛者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O005"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0094","role":"被流放者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O005"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"薨于永安","evidence":["huangli-q-e1483ff918bac0db8db5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":223,"label":"建兴元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y223","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o021","basis":"建兴元年"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o022b-q","zhuge-q-o021","wendi-q-o038","wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o022b-q","source_order":[35,133,"O022b"],"order":6781}],"persons":[{"id":"houzhu-p0021","name":"朱褒","evidence":["houzhu-q-P009a","huangli-q-d6880fb35d8a8e416986","huangli-q-694dff6b5d17f718e768"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-O005-houzhu-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-O005"]},{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-P009-houzhu-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-P009"]},{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-P009a-houzhu-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-P009a"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O005","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-79ab2e26e514bf6b9ab6","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年夏〖3〗，牂牁太守朱褒拥郡反〖4〗。﹝二﹞先是，益州郡有大姓雍闿反〖5〗，流太守张裔于吴〖6〗，据郡不宾〖7〗；越嶲夷王高定亦背叛〖8〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-P009","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-53b96eb73d836c301397","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“初，益州从事常房行部；闻褒将有异志，收其主簿案问，杀之。褒怒，攻杀房，诬以谋反。诸葛亮诛房诸子，徙其四弟于越嶲，欲以安之。褒犹不悛改，遂以郡叛应雍闿。”臣松之按：以为房为褒所诬，执政所宜澄察；安有妄杀不辜，以悦奸慝？斯殆妄矣！","attribution":"裴注","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578